			<div class="content" id="post-content-2234799">
									

<p>Certainly your own opinion and you're entitled to it, but as Decibelle explained below, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/and-this-one-explains-humes">Kant Counters and Scranton Reality Anchors are a real thing and have been a pretty major part of site lore for a while now</a>.</p>
<p>Additionally, SCPs that contain SCPs are also a real thing, and they're called Thaumiel-class objects. What you're describing, however, is just a piece of equipment, and not a skip.</p>
